    "“影响”按课程分数相对本地加权均分的偏离程度乘以学分排序，不是官方 GPA 预测。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\"Impact\" is ranked by the deviation of course scores from the locally weighted average multiplied by the credits, not an official GPA prediction."
